  <running_head>DE HOMINIS GRATITUD.</running_head>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">ceptis tradit, quo pacto nos erga Deum gera-</l>
    <l n="2">mus: Posterior, sex praeceptis, quae officia pro-</l>
    <l n="3">ximo debeamus{1}[?]</l>
    <l n="4" type="heading" level="2" para="true">
      <i>Quid postulat Deus primo præcepto?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="5" para="true">Vt, quám mihi chara est salus animæ meæ,</l>
    <l n="6">tam studiosé vitem &amp; fugiam omnem idolo-</l>
    <l n="7">latriam{b}, magiam, incantationem, superstiti-</l>
    <l n="8">onem{c}: invocationem sanctorum, aut cætera-</l>
    <l n="9">rum creaturarum{d}: unicum autem &amp; verum De-</l>
    <l n="10">um recte agnoscam{e}, ipsi soli fidem{f},</l>
    <l n="11">summa humilitate{g}, &amp; patientia me illi subiiciam{h},</l>
    <l n="12">ab eo solo omnia bona expectem{i}, denique inti-</l>
    <l n="13">mo cordis affectu ipsum amem{k}, reverear{l}, ve-</l>
    <l n="14">nerer{m}, adeò ut omnibus potius creaturis re-</l>
    <l n="15">nuntiem, quám ut vel minimum contra eius vo-</l>
    <l n="16">luntatem committam{n}.</l>
    <l n="17" type="heading" level="2" para="true">
      <i>Quid est idololatria?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18" para="true">Est loco unius Dei, aut præter unum illum</l>
    <l n="19">&amp; verum Deum, qui se in suo verbo patefecit,</l>
    <l n="20">aliud quippiam fingere aut habere, in quo re-</l>
    <l n="21">ponas spem{o}.</l>
    <l n="22" type="heading" level="2" para="true">
      <i>Quid postulat secundum præceptum?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23" para="true">Ne Deum ulla imagine aut figura exprima-</l>
    <l n="24">mus{p}, neve ulla alia ratione eum colamus,</l>
    <l n="25">quám qua se in suo verbo coli præcepit{q},</l>
    <l n="26" type="heading" level="2" para="true">
      <i>An ulla ergo prorsus fingendæ sunt imagines</i>
    </l>
    <l n="27" type="heading" level="2">
      <i>aut simulachra?</i>
    </l>
    <l n="28" para="true">Deus nec ulla ratione effingi debet, nec po-</l>
    <l n="29">test: creaturas autem, etsi exprimere quidè licet veta</l>
  </main_text>
